title: "GH-1408: Reduce omission receipt overhead for explicit scalar field projections"
description: Explicit field reads spend most emitted bytes on restoration hints for intentionally excluded groups; define a compact caller-selected omission policy without hiding unexpected truncation or changing read identity.
